  Text:
    m_Untranslated: 'You have successfully setup the minimum components needed to
      enable your project with VirtualGrasp.


      You have learned which is the
      main component and how to connect an avatar in your scene with controller input.


      To
      finish this tutorial, you can now play your scene.'
